<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rate wider, one-week rate down.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rate wider, one-week rate down.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened in a liquid private sector market on Monday to between 9 3/16 and 10 1/2 percent from Sunday's range of 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said one-week rates were down to between 9 1/4 and 10 3/8 from 10 3/8 and 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1 REUTER ME CEH</p>
